 "insight": [
  "The largest changes in Luxembourg's imports between 2024 and 2025 among non-EU27 countries were from Japan and China.",
  "Imports from Japan increased by 904.2 million euros, reaching 1.13 billion euros in 2025.",
  "Imports from China rose by 607.3 million euros, reaching 761.3 million euros in 2025.",
  "Imports from Canada decreased by 74.8 million euros, falling to 53.9 million euros in 2025.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, and 4.1% of trade involves undisclosed partners not included in country rankings."
 ],
